  "about_us": {
    "title": "About us",
    "description": "At CanaryMed we work with the goal of facilitating access to healthcare information for all people living in or visiting the Canary Islands. Our purpose is to help users quickly and easily find the medical centers that best suit their needs, thus contributing to improving their well-being and health.\n\nOur platform works as a medical center comparator, where users can consult different available options and access relevant information such as location, specialties offered, and prices of certain services. In this way, we aim to provide a clear and useful tool to make informed decisions about healthcare.\n\nIn this first stage, CanaryMed mainly focuses on medical centers located in Gran Canaria. However, our medium and long-term goal is to expand the platform to include centers from other islands of the archipelago, offering an increasingly complete service to the entire Canarian community.\n\nFrom a business model perspective, CanaryMed is sustained through collaborations with medical centers, which can participate through service commissions or subscription fees. This model allows us to continue developing the platform and continuously improve the user experience.\n\nAt CanaryMed we believe that access to clear, organized and accessible healthcare information can make a difference, and we work every day to bring healthcare closer to people in a simpler and more transparent way."
  },

